{"metadata":{"title":"Apple Push Certificate","modules":[{"name":"BrazeKit"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Related-Documentation","title":"Related Documentation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Braze\/tutorials\/Braze\/b1-standard-push-notifications"]},{"anchor":"Push-Notifications","title":"Push Notifications","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Braze\/tutorials\/Braze\/b1-standard-push-notifications","doc:\/\/Braze\/tutorials\/Braze\/b2-rich-push-notifications","doc:\/\/Braze\/tutorials\/Braze\/b3-push-stories","doc:\/\/Braze\/tutorials\/Braze\/b4-live-activities"],"generated":true}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Braze\/documentation\/BrazeKit"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Create an Apple Push file or certificate."}],"kind":"article","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Braze\/documentation\/Braze\/apns-certificate","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Before you can send a push notification using Braze, you must provide your Push notification file or certificate from Apple. You may present either a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".p8"},{"type":"text","text":" file (recommended) or a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".p12"},{"type":"text","text":" certificate."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":".p8 File (recommended)","anchor":"p8-File-recommended","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"As described on this ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/help.apple.com\/developer-account\/#\/devcdfbb56a3","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In your developer account, go to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/account\/ios\/certificate","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Under Keys, select All and click the Add button (+) in the upper-right corner."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Under Key Description, enter a unique name for the signing key."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Under Key Services, select the APNs checkbox, then click Continue. Click "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Confirm","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note the Key ID. Click "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Download","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to generate and download the key now."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When you download the key, it is saved as a text file with a .p8 file extension. Save the file in a secure place because the key is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not saved in your developer account and you won’t be able to download it again"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note","name":"Note","type":"aside"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Navigate to the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/dashboard-01.braze.com\/app_settings\/app_settings","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" page in the dashboard and upload the .p8 file.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When prompted, also enter your app’s "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/account\/ios\/identifier\/bundle\/","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/account\/ios\/authkey","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" that you noted when generating the key, and your "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/account\/#\/membership","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Click "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Save","type":"text"}]},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":3,"text":".p12 Certificate (legacy)","type":"heading","anchor":"p12-Certificate-legacy"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Alternatively, you may utilize Apple’s older authentication scheme ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".p12"},{"type":"text","text":" SSL certificates). Unlike the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".p8"},{"type":"text","text":" solution described above, these certificates automatically expire every year and will require you to regenerate and re-upload them. Braze will send you email reminders as the certificate approaches expiration to help your notifications continue uninterrupted, but because this is a manual process we recommend utilizing the above-described "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".p8"},{"type":"text","text":" authentication scheme instead. However, if you still wish to, you may configure and upload "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".p12"},{"type":"text","text":" certificates as described here:"}]},{"level":4,"text":"Step 1: Generate Certificate Signing Request","type":"heading","anchor":"Step-1-Generate-Certificate-Signing-Request"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Navigate to the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/ios\/manage\/overview\/index.action","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Select "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Identifiers","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" in the left sidebar and filter "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"App Ids","type":"text"}]},{"text":" using the button on the right of the page ","type":"text"},{"type":"image","identifier":"apns-certificate-identifiers-app-ids.png"}]}]},{"conte